        "original_id": "e38749ab-9df2-58a1-94ad-ef5dbcfb1b52",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Blair Cramer, Kassie DePaiva\n- Roles: Blair Cramer, Chelsea Reardon, Eve Donovan\n- Shows: One Life to Live, General Hospital, Guiding Light, Days of Our Lives\n- Organizations: ABC Daytime, NBC\n\nFacts:\n- Kassie DePaiva played Blair Cramer on ABC Daytime's \"One Life to Live\" from December 17, 1993 until the show's original finale on January 13, 2012.\n- Kassie DePaiva made several guest appearances as Blair Cramer on ABC Daytime's \"General Hospital\" from March 2, 2012 through December 3, 2012.\n- Blair Cramer became most associated with actress Kassie DePaiva.\n- Kassie DePaiva also played Chelsea Reardon on \"Guiding Light\".\n- Kassie DePaiva later played Eve Donovan on NBC's \"Days of Our Lives\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
